WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.985 --> 00:00:05.452
How to create an App with no money?

00:00:05.763 --> 00:00:08.202
So I got a great question from my YouTube viewers

00:00:08.202 --> 00:00:09.308
(love you guys!)

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:10.744
PANTYHOSEPAM

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:12.002
who wrote in to say

00:00:12.724 --> 00:00:16.074
“Hello Evan, I have a real multimillion pound app

00:00:16.381 --> 00:00:19.331
unfortunately just an idea and it is unique at the moment

00:00:19.351 --> 00:00:21.413
such an app hasn’t been released yet.

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:23.635
The problem is I can’t write the code for it

00:00:23.726 --> 00:00:25.681
and I can’t pay all the code writers for the job.

00:00:25.829 --> 00:00:28.319
What would you suggest? Thank you, Pam.”

00:00:28.513 --> 00:00:30.925
Great question and

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:32.847
usually when I make these videos

00:00:32.847 --> 00:00:34.852
I give 3 suggestions for what you can do.

00:00:35.009 --> 00:00:36.959
For you, I really just have one

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:37.929
and that’s partner up.

00:00:38.321 --> 00:00:39.781
Find somebody

00:00:40.015 --> 00:00:41.586
who loves programming

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:44.020
just as much as you love creating

00:00:44.026 --> 00:00:45.348
and marketing stuff

00:00:45.642 --> 00:00:46.607
and

00:00:46.607 --> 00:00:47.747
work together.

00:00:47.789 --> 00:00:49.939
Because if you don’t have the funds

00:00:49.953 --> 00:00:51.582
to hire somebody on board

00:00:51.582 --> 00:00:54.080
then the best bet is to have somebody on your team

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:55.662
who’s just as committed to this as you.

00:00:55.912 --> 00:00:57.630
It’s hard to run a technology company

00:00:57.682 --> 00:00:58.281
when you don’t have a

00:00:58.281 --> 00:01:00.558
technology person in the business

00:01:00.558 --> 00:01:01.253
because there’s going to be

00:01:01.253 --> 00:01:02.638
so many issues that come up

00:01:02.768 --> 00:01:04.514
where you need technical expertise

00:01:04.522 --> 00:01:06.443
and if you can’t afford to hire somebody

00:01:06.455 --> 00:01:07.580
then you have to have somebody

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.882
who’s a partner in the business.

00:01:09.346 --> 00:01:10.961
And it’s also great because you have somebody

00:01:11.119 --> 00:01:13.984
who’s committed to it just like you are, right

00:01:13.984 --> 00:01:16.141
If something crashes at 3 in the morning

00:01:16.631 --> 00:01:18.455
your employee’s not going to wake up and go to work

00:01:18.612 --> 00:01:19.530
but your partner is

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:21.649
and so it’s finding that right person.

00:01:21.716 --> 00:01:23.045
What you need to do is

00:01:23.108 --> 00:01:24.839
figure out what your skill sets are.

00:01:24.839 --> 00:01:26.334
And so if you want to do the marketing

00:01:26.334 --> 00:01:27.556
the promotion, the branding of it

00:01:27.556 --> 00:01:29.050
that’s what you’re really good at

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:31.249
and you have this awesome idea for an app

00:01:31.628 --> 00:01:33.982
you want the people who love making apps

00:01:34.438 --> 00:01:35.696
who’ve created great apps

00:01:35.983 --> 00:01:37.807
and I get people writing to me all the time

00:01:37.807 --> 00:01:38.830
“I’ve created this great app

00:01:39.219 --> 00:01:40.732
but I don’t know how to market it

00:01:40.735 --> 00:01:42.001
and I don’t know how to brand it

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:43.001
I don’t know how to promote it

00:01:43.001 --> 00:01:44.196
and get the word to spread about.

00:01:44.196 --> 00:01:45.781
All I want to do is create apps.”

00:01:45.971 --> 00:01:47.502
That’s who you need to partner with.

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:48.992
So I would go out

00:01:48.994 --> 00:01:51.083
and find people in the industry, right

00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:52.878
whatever industry you’re trying to target

00:01:52.939 --> 00:01:55.421
if it’s healthcare or sports or children

00:01:55.421 --> 00:01:56.492
or whatever it is

00:01:56.492 --> 00:01:58.768
find people who’ve created apps in that industry

00:01:59.575 --> 00:02:01.973
that are great app developers

00:02:02.157 --> 00:02:03.307
but haven’t done a great job marketing

00:02:03.826 --> 00:02:05.177
and partner up with them and say

00:02:05.177 --> 00:02:06.414
“Hey, I have this great idea for an app.

00:02:06.665 --> 00:02:08.911
Let’s split it. Let’s work together on this.

00:02:08.919 --> 00:02:10.505
You code it. I’ve got this great idea

00:02:11.345 --> 00:02:13.384
and I will go out there and market it

00:02:13.384 --> 00:02:14.806
and together we can build a great team.”

00:02:14.816 --> 00:02:16.032
That’s who you need to find,

00:02:16.032 --> 00:02:17.134
so partner up.

00:02:17.134 --> 00:02:18.236
Believe.

00:02:18.426 --> 00:02:20.066
For those of you watching you like the video

00:02:20.066 --> 00:02:20.860
